      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TERRIFIC NERO (2) shapes as hard to beat after winning last start over the 530m at this track in a speedy 30.62. In winning form and can measure up again. AILEEN'S SHINE (1) had been in great form but missed the frame latest when seventh (31.49) in a Grade 6 at this track. Generally a safe beginner but never in it last time. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. NO EAR TRINDALL (4) goes very well here starting seven times for three wins and three minors. Placed last time (31.07) at this track in a Grade 6, finishing second and beaten 1.5 lengths. Suited here and expected to run well. BILLY BUST UP (7) is in the mix despite missing out at this track last time.",
